# Check everything out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Go source is defined to use LF and gofmt enforces it, so a Windows checkout
# that converts to CRLF makes every file look unformatted. Pinning it here also
# keeps the shell scripts runnable from a Windows checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.duckdb binary
*.db binary
